<title>USA: Petsec Energy unit issues $100 mln in debt.</title>
<headline>Petsec Energy unit issues $100 mln in debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following 144a debt issue from Petsec Energy Inc was priced in the U.S. high-yield bond market via a Merrill Lynch &amp; Co Inc syndicate, according to market sources.</p>
<p>Petsec Energy Inc is a wholly-owned operating subsidiary of Australia's Petsec Energy Ltd. The companies are engaged in oil and gas productiona and exploration.</p>
<p>BORROWER PETSEC ENERGY INC</p>
<p>AMT $100 MLN	   COUPON 9-1/2 PCT  MATURITY 6/15/2007</p>
<p>TYPE SNR SUB NOTES   ISS PRICE 99.617  FIRST PAY DATE 12/15/97</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S B3	YIELD 9.56 PCT    PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P NOT RATED   SPREAD 295 BPS    CALLABLE NON CALL FIVE</p>
<p>NOTE: Three year equity call for 1/3 of issue at 109.50.</p>
<p>U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212-859-1672</p>
</text>
